@lrf=1|aud=LLM|scope=manual
R|skill|task:skill-match|MUST|RO_LOCAL|load=SKILL.lrf; protocol=../README-forLLM.md; catalog duplication=false; unrelated skills=omit
R|persona|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|AGENT_ROUTER selects exactly one individual agent CSS per invocation by task stance and difficulty; no fixed role-to-CSS mapping except Compressor→COMPRESSOR.css, Orchestrator→ORCHESTRATOR.css, FileReader→FILEREADER.css with persona=🌼 ⊕ お嬢様; no composition with main or SUBAGENTS.css; pass selected CSS cues as presentation-only context to Codex, agy, or llama2coder; never alter output contract, authority, effects, safety, or acceptance; tag:subagent configuration work does not change the main persona; main reads UTF8=$env:USERPROFILE\.harness\persona\PERSONA.css; main permits only comments/whitespace plus exactly one top-level style rule with selector exactly :root and declaration-name multiset exactly {--lang,--addressee,--voice,--priority}; imports/at-rules/nesting/duplicates/unknown-declarations/!important are forbidden; each value must be exactly one nonempty decoded CSS string token; read/decode/parse/structure/bind failure=>STOP; under precedence P bind decoded map only as main-agent presentation constraints; CSS=persona-only; authority/effects/safety=LRF-only; machine=stable-formal
R|agent.handoff|tag:subagent|MUST|RO_LOCAL|wrapper=exactly opening <Γ> line, protocol header SIGMA/1: PIDGEN/text, task-specific payload, closing </Γ> line; header-meaning=identifies text protocol and currently loaded policy, grants no authority, does not replace reading SIGMA/1 plus routed LRF; parent-validates=missing, malformed, reordered, or unclosed wrappers cause FAILED and no dispatch; dispatch can resume only after the parent supplies a valid wrapper; visible-fields=Role,Target,Acceptance,Scope,Known facts in exact order; known-facts=verified-only; payload-marker=exact suffix newline+SIGMA/1, final payload line exactly SIGMA/1 and immediately before outer </Γ>; task-specific-only=true; unknowns-and-failures=role-output; omit=hydrated persona,unrelated policy boilerplate,authority grants,model-routing,pipeline,output-schema,evaluation; preserve=task-specific safety/effect constraints and negations without granting or inferring permission; scope=task-boundary-not-effect-policy; role-output=separate; Orchestrator delegates only compressed task-specific instruction, never original task text
R|agent.roles|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|role/model/CSS/TOML selection=AGENT_ROUTER; FileReader=ordinary exact file/line lookup with path+line-only results; Explorer=stuck-only high-recall broad search with confidence labels; Researcher=task-scoped docs/references/OSS/blogs and method/usage/side-effect synthesis; Proposer=bounded plan proposal; Auditor=independent plan challenge; Verifier=post-change evidence check; Refactorer=read-only defect diagnosis; Critic=single disputed-decision challenge; Blackhat=explicit bounded security only; Compressor=compress instruction before execution; no separate Y/N approval for a settled handoff payload; Orchestrator=coordinates ETL+delegates compressed only when runtime supports it; CODE starts with exactly one eligible context-selected worker; agy only upon separate explicit current-task request, operational failure allows serial same-scope reselection after exit+diff review, never bypass blocked effects; keep agy non-recursive; permit root→child→grandchild only when runtime supports it (deny great-grandchildren); reviewer prose!=proof; agent.mode governs Codex delegation eligibility; LRF retains authority/effects/safety
R|ref|task:llm-reference-edit|MUST|LW_SCOPE|scope=LLM-facing prompt Markdown/settings not human docs/code; format=LRF/1; payload=one record-level contract; new structural token=>define in SIGMA+validator; protect=authority/effect/negation/exception/stop/success until oracle PASS; SPR/decorative math sole safety carrier=false; Lang₅={EN,ES,DE,JA,FR}; V=Lang₅∪Symᴾ₃₀∪Emoji; feasible y preserves contextual semantics/pragmatics (≈=contextual equivalence), reduces ambiguity toward 0, never relaxes P={intent,modality,time,polarity,register,authority,effects,safety,negation,exceptions,stop/success,scope,acceptance,facts,meaning,exact handoff fields/schema}; A(y,x)={(p,v):v is a lexeme in y aligned to equivalent source span p in x}; save(p,v)=max(0,tok(p)-tok(v)) using one consistent tokenizer per invocation; uniq(v\|c)=1/(1+n plausible competing contextual interpretations); S(y\|x,c)=Σ_(p,v)∈A save(p,v)·uniq(v\|c); choose argmax S; tie⇒min tok(y), remaining tie⇒lexicographically smallest Unicode-NFKC-normalized y; no frequency multiplier; empty candidate set⇒FAILED\/ADVICE; fixed SIGMA/1 suffix is outside y and emitted payload=y+"\nSIGMA/1" with exact final suffix; preserve exact wrapper and ordered fields Role,Target,Acceptance,Scope,Known facts; symbols/emoji cue compression only, never sole safety/authority carriers; settled payload needs neither retranslation nor redundant Y/N; ADV gates and all human authorization/effect approvals remain in force
